      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهوّش</span></b> : see 1, first sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهوّشوا</span>
